## TUNE-001 — DET-006 Refinement

### Detection

```text
DET-006 — Remote Administrative SMB Logon
```

### Problem

Event ID 4624 represents successful Windows authentication and is generated frequently during normal system activity.

Using:

```text
EventCode=4624
```

alone can produce excessive unrelated results.

### Recommended Improvement

Future DET-006 tuning should incorporate additional context such as:

```text
EventCode=4624
LogonType=3
Source IP
Target account
Target host
Administrative context
```

Additional SMB or administrative-share telemetry should be incorporated where available.

### Status

```text
OPEN
```

